  "description_short": "Contemporary dining in Blanco with garden views, craft cocktails, and a menu that celebrates local flavours.",
  "description_long": "Perched in the tranquil Blanco area just outside George, The Terrace offers a refreshing escape from the ordinary. The restaurant's spacious indoor and outdoor seating areas overlook lush gardens, making it an ideal spot for leisurely lunches or relaxed dinners. The atmosphere strikes a balance between casual and refined, welcoming families, couples, and groups alike.\n\nThe menu showcases contemporary South African cuisine with international influences, featuring quality steaks, fresh seafood, and vegetarian options that change with the seasons. Their craft cocktails and carefully selected wine list complement the food perfectly. Whether you're settling in for a lazy Sunday breakfast or celebrating a special occasion, the friendly service and consistently good food make it worth the short drive from George's town centre.\n\nThe Terrace has become a local favourite for its relaxed vibe and reliable kitchen. It's the kind of place where you can bring the kids for a casual meal or enjoy a romantic evening under the stars, with the garden setting providing a peaceful backdrop to any occasion.",
